  description: "The Rask's commander: a decorated Rask officer with a gold crest and a purple cape. With 10 health and Armor Level 2 the Ultima is sturdier than the Rask it leads, but carries only a Pistol (2 damage, penetration 0, 10 m) and, as a Solo unit, is a prime target. It moves 20 m (40 m sprinting). A Commander: every army needs exactly one."
